<div class="side-by-side">
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>

  <p>
    Fortnite OG was an emotional moment for the Fortnite community. In a first-of-its-kind content event, fans returned to the original map, which had been removed from the game in 2017. Epic Games needed a tournament to promote the event and celebrate with fans and influencers, and it had to feel like a homecoming.
  </p>
</div>

