<h2>The Solution</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Class of 2017?</p>
  <p>
    Of the concepts I presented, "The Reunion" won. The name connects to class reunions and seeing old friends. Epic liked it, and I built the trailer style around that idea.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Trailer Built Around a Cake</p>
  <p>
    To make The Reunion feel like a celebration, I pitched the Fortnite team on a massive cake shaped like the returning map. They liked the concept and worked with me to decide which iconic locations would return, and together we unveiled The Reunion to fans.
  </p>
</div>

