<h2>The Impact</h2>
<p>
  Fans responded to the cake concept, which earned 2M+ impressions and 69K+ social engagements. The tournament reached 811K hours watched and 234K peak viewers, making it one of 2023's biggest Fortnite tournaments, and its influencer streams outperformed Epic's official channel.
</p>

